# Old Faithful density: faithfuld

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:giggly, path: Path.join(__DIR__, "..")},
  {:kino, "~> 0.19"}
  ])
```

## About this notebook

ggplot2's reference page for [`faithfuld`](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/faithfuld.html)
has no examples, so this notebook says only what the page describes and where Giggly stands.

`faithfuld` is a two-dimensional density estimate of R's `faithful` data on the Old Faithful
geyser: 5,625 rows, each a pair of an eruption time and a waiting time to the next eruption, both
in minutes, with the estimated density there. Not in Giggly yet: the `faithfuld` dataset.
